# Task 149-010: src/connectors/ Base + IMessageConnector Interface

## Plan

### Files to Create
1. `src/connectors/types.ts` — ConnectorId, IncomingMessage, OutgoingMessage, IMessageConnector, ConnectorConfig interfaces
2. `src/connectors/base-connector.ts` — Abstract BaseConnector class with event emitter pattern
3. `tests/connectors/base-connector.test.ts` — 5 tests covering lifecycle, handlers, health, schema, errors

### Design Decisions
- Follow ProviderAdapter pattern from src/core/provider.ts (readonly fields, async lifecycle)
- BaseConnector uses handler array pattern (not EventEmitter inheritance to avoid Node coupling)
- Lightweight, no external deps — pure TypeScript interfaces + abstract class
- ESM with .js extensions per ADR-001/002

### Approach
1. Create src/connectors/ directory
2. Write types.ts with all interfaces
3. Write base-connector.ts abstract class
4. Write tests
5. Verify with tsc + vitest
